# This repository uses component-specific environment templates.
#
# Databricks table setup and local credential checks:
#   Copy databricks/.env.example to databricks/.env
#
# Local FastAPI development:
#   Use backend/.env.example as a variable reference and export the values in
#   your shell. Production values are entered from backend/render.yaml.
#
# Optional Next.js dashboard:
#   Copy web/.env.example to web/.env.local
#
# Never commit real tokens, passwords, pairing codes, or .env files.
